+    # pinned condition the other two profiles state as `--prefill-step-size`.
+    # `llama-server` defaults it to 512 where `mlx_lm.server` defaults its own
+    # to 2048, so leaving it unstated compares a 4x difference in chunk size and
+    # calls it a difference between runtimes. Admission refuses a launch that
+    # leaves it out; `--batch-size` is the logical batch and does not pin it.
+    "--ubatch-size", "2048",
